  "title": "Climate Crisis and Health: Education of health professionals for Transformative Action, Germany",
  "summary": "Launched by the German Climate Change and Health Alliance in 2020, the \"Planetary Health Academy\" lecture series aims to raise awareness, educate health professionals, and encourage transformative action on climate-related medical challenges. The Academy provides practical solutions and offers free online lectures for healthcare workers. The health sector plays a central role in communicating, preventing and following up on the effects of the climate and environmental crisis.",
